  <diagram name="Page-1" id="P4W9JpSF2l0RFPWTLtYG">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1030" dy="622" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="&lt;div class=&quot;n6owBd awi2gc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACAwQAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-subtree=&quot;aimfl,mfl&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Infrastructure as Code (IaC) is the management of servers, networks, and storage through human-readable definition files rather than manual physical setup&lt;/span&gt;. Containerization packages an application with its runtime and dependencies into a single immutable image. &lt;mark class=&quot;HxTRcb&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-wiz-uids=&quot;KRwBFc_v&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDBAD&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-inited=&quot;2&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;They link together because &lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;IaC provisions the underlying environment&lt;/strong&gt;, while &lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;containers run the application inside it&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/mark&gt;.&lt;span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://rapidscale.com/blog/cloud/benefits-of-infrastructure-as-code-iac-with-ci-cd-pipelines&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTt6Ol_jalI&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=efRu7odnEQo&quot;&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.javacodegeeks.com/2023/06/iac-and-containers.html&quot;&gt;4&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://dzone.com/articles/iac-and-containers&quot;&gt;5&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-inited=&quot;2&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;aria-level=KRwBFc_19/fLk2Md&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;How IaC and Containerization Connect&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQ-7AUegoIAggACAAIGxAA&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-bfc=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAB&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQAQ&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQAg&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Provisioning the Foundation&lt;/strong&gt;: Tools like Terraform use IaC to spin up virtual servers, load balancers, and cloud container clusters (like AWS ECS or Google Kubernetes Engine).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirantis.com/blog/kubernetes-infrastructure-as-code-iac-best-practices-and-guide/&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.xenonstack.com/insights/infrastructure-as-code-containers&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-bfc=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAH&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQBw&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQCA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Running the Workload&lt;/strong&gt;: Once IaC builds the cluster, container tools (like Docker or Kubernetes manifests) deploy the actual application packages onto those resources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/infrastructure-code-iac-vs-containers-pedro-castelo-branco-louren%C3%A7o&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.paloaltonetworks.com/cyberpedia/kubernetes-infrastructure-as-code&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://dysnix.com/blog/iaas-providers&quot;&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.xenonstack.com/insights/infrastructure-as-code-containers&quot;&gt;4&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-bfc=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAN&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQDQ&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQDg&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Shared Philosophy&lt;/strong&gt;: Both rely on declarative configuration files (YAML, JSON) to ensure that deployments are repeatable, version-controlled, and identical across testing and production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.paloaltonetworks.com/cyberpedia/kubernetes-infrastructure-as-code&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirantis.com/blog/kubernetes-infrastructure-as-code-iac-best-practices-and-guide/&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.xenonstack.com/insights/infrastructure-as-code-containers&quot;&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-bfc=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAT&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQEw&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQFA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Orchestration Layer&lt;/strong&gt;: Advanced orchestrators like Kubernetes blur the line, using declarative IaC principles to manage both infrastructure state and container scaling simultaneously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.paloaltonetworks.com/cyberpedia/kubernetes-infrastructure-as-code&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vmware.com/topics/infrastructure-as-code&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" link="&lt;div class=&quot;n6owBd awi2gc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACAwQAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-subtree=&quot;aimfl,mfl&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Infrastructure as Code (IaC) is the management of servers, networks, and storage through human-readable definition files rather than manual physical setup&lt;/span&gt;. Containerization packages an application with its runtime and dependencies into a single immutable image. &lt;mark class=&quot;HxTRcb&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-wiz-uids=&quot;KRwBFc_v&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQuJAPegoIAggACAAIDBAD&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-inited=&quot;2&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;They link together because &lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;IaC provisions the underlying environment&lt;/strong&gt;, while &lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;containers run the application inside it&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/mark&gt;.&lt;span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://rapidscale.com/blog/cloud/benefits-of-infrastructure-as-code-iac-with-ci-cd-pipelines&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pTt6Ol_jalI&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=efRu7odnEQo&quot;&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.javacodegeeks.com/2023/06/iac-and-containers.html&quot;&gt;4&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://dzone.com/articles/iac-and-containers&quot;&gt;5&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-inited=&quot;2&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;aria-level=KRwBFc_19/fLk2Md&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;How IaC and Containerization Connect&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQ-7AUegoIAggACAAIGxAA&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-bfc=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAB&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQAQ&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQAg&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Provisioning the Foundation&lt;/strong&gt;: Tools like Terraform use IaC to spin up virtual servers, load balancers, and cloud container clusters (like AWS ECS or Google Kubernetes Engine).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirantis.com/blog/kubernetes-infrastructure-as-code-iac-best-practices-and-guide/&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.xenonstack.com/insights/infrastructure-as-code-containers&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-bfc=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAH&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQBw&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQCA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Running the Workload&lt;/strong&gt;: Once IaC builds the cluster, container tools (like Docker or Kubernetes manifests) deploy the actual application packages onto those resources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/infrastructure-code-iac-vs-containers-pedro-castelo-branco-louren%C3%A7o&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.paloaltonetworks.com/cyberpedia/kubernetes-infrastructure-as-code&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://dysnix.com/blog/iaas-providers&quot;&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.xenonstack.com/insights/infrastructure-as-code-containers&quot;&gt;4&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-bfc=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAN&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQDQ&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQDg&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Shared Philosophy&lt;/strong&gt;: Both rely on declarative configuration files (YAML, JSON) to ensure that deployments are repeatable, version-controlled, and identical across testing and production.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.paloaltonetworks.com/cyberpedia/kubernetes-infrastructure-as-code&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mirantis.com/blog/kubernetes-infrastructure-as-code-iac-best-practices-and-guide/&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.xenonstack.com/insights/infrastructure-as-code-containers&quot;&gt;3&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-bfc=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjAmKy5-6yWAxXbRmwGHRxyEnQQi4wTegoIAggACAAIGxAT&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQEw&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;li class=&quot;Z1qcYe&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBsQFA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;iNqyIf&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Orchestration Layer&lt;/strong&gt;: Advanced orchestrators like Kubernetes blur the line, using declarative IaC principles to manage both infrastructure state and container scaling simultaneously.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; [&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.paloaltonetworks.com/cyberpedia/kubernetes-infrastructure-as-code&quot;&gt;1&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vmware.com/topics/infrastructure-as-code&quot;&gt;2&lt;/a&gt;]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" id="SGVk95uqvsqB6heck2Jb-1">
          <mxCell parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="480" width="560" x="10" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
